    "text": "wgxa.tv\nwebsite\nCordele\nMan injured after shooting in Cordele, search for suspect underway\nBy Jordan Stevenson,\n7 hours agoCORDELE, Ga. (WGXA) — Police in Cordele are searching for a suspect in a shooting that left one person injured. According to the Cordele Police Department (CPD), officers drove to Cardinal Avenue at around 4:30 a.m. after hearing gunshots while on patrol in the area. When they got to the scene, they found a man who had been shot.\n5",
